  "claude_prompt_template": "CLAUDE: Generate {N} quizzes for the PASSION cluster of QuissMe. \n\nUSE THE ATTACHED POLES:\n- INITIATOR, RESPONDER, EXPRESSOR, RECEIVER, INTENSITY_HIGH, INTENSITY_LOW, EXPLORER, CULTIVATOR\n\nFOLLOW THIS SCHEMA:\n{\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"passion_01\",\n      \"indicator\": \"initiation_style\",\n      \"context\": \"Positives Beziehungs-Szenario\",\n      \"text\": \"Offene Frage\",\n      \"options\": [\n        { \"text\": \"Option die INITIATOR zeigt\", \"scores\": { \"INITIATOR\": 3 } },\n        { \"text\": \"Option die RESPONDER zeigt\", \"scores\": { \"RESPONDER\": 3 } },\n        { \"text\": \"Option die EXPRESSOR zeigt\", \"scores\": { \"EXPRESSOR\": 3 } },\n        { \"text\": \"Option die RECEIVER zeigt\", \"scores\": { \"RECEIVER\": 3 } }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\nRULES:\n1. ALWAYS positive framing (see attached rules)\n2. Use German language\n3. Make scenarios relatable and warm\n4. Mix poles fairly across questions\n5. Return valid JSON only\n\nOutput the JSON directly."
